# --- Evaluation output ---
# Transient run reports stay out of git. The measured Phase B baseline is a
# record of what retrieval actually scored, so it belongs in history.
reports/*
!reports/retrieval_baseline.json
!reports/reranking_comparison.json
!reports/golden_baseline.json
!src/evaluation/baseline.json

